{
  "_comment": "NextRaiden P1 战斗核心冒烟：按住开火飞完前 40 秒，验证波次出怪、子弹命中、计分、物理碎片产生并被回收。玩家开 nr.invincible，所以这条脚本测的是进攻侧，不是躲弹能力。",
  "_comment_timing": "等待一律用 game.stageTime，不用 wait-frames（见 nextraiden-smoke 里的说明）。关卡秒数就是墙钟秒数，所以跑满这条脚本要 40 秒出头，timeoutMs 必须给够。",
  "name": "nextraiden-combat",
  "target": "NextRaiden",
  "viewport": {
    "width": 1600,
    "height": 900
  },
  "defaults": {
    "waitFrames": 2,
    "stepTimeoutMs": 60000
  },
  "steps": [
    {
      "type": "wait-until",
      "query": "engine.status",
      "op": "eq",
      "value": "Running"
    },
    {
      "type": "wait-until",
      "query": "game.state",
      "op": "eq",
      "value": "playing"
    },
    {
      "type": "log",
      "message": "波次表必须全部解析出来：29 条。少一条就是 stage1_waves.json 里有被严格解析拒掉的波次"
    },
    {
      "type": "assert",
      "query": "game.wavesTotal",
      "op": "eq",
      "value": 29
    },
    {
      "type": "cvar",
      "name": "nr.invincible",
      "set": "true"
    },
    {
      "type": "key",
      "code": "Z",
      "action": "down"
    },
    {
      "type": "log",
      "message": "12 秒：前两波 scout 应该已经进场并被打掉一些"
    },
    {
      "type": "wait-until",
      "query": "game.stageTime",
      "op": "gt",
      "value": 12.0
    },
    {
      "type": "assert",
      "query": "game.wavesFired",
      "op": "ge",
      "value": 2
    },
    {
      "type": "assert",
      "query": "game.kills",
      "op": "gt",
      "value": 0
    },
    {
      "type": "assert",
      "query": "game.score",
      "op": "gt",
      "value": 0
    },
    {
      "type": "log",
      "message": "打死东西就该有物理碎块在飞或在地上躺着"
    },
    {
      "type": "assert",
      "query": "game.debrisAlive",
      "op": "gt",
      "value": 0
    },
    {
      "type": "screenshot",
      "out": "screenshots/combat_early",
      "ui": true
    },
    {
      "type": "log",
      "message": "26 秒：interceptor 弧线波，敌弹应该在场上"
    },
    {
      "type": "wait-until",
      "query": "game.stageTime",
      "op": "gt",
      "value": 26.0
    },
    {
      "type": "assert",
      "query": "game.wavesFired",
      "op": "ge",
      "value": 5
    },
    {
      "type": "screenshot",
      "out": "screenshots/combat_mid",
      "ui": true
    },
    {
      "type": "log",
      "message": "48 秒：前 11 波已放完（t=45 那波是第 10 条）；无敌下不该掉命"
    },
    {
      "type": "wait-until",
      "query": "game.stageTime",
      "op": "gt",
      "value": 48.0
    },
    {
      "type": "assert",
      "query": "game.wavesFired",
      "op": "ge",
      "value": 10
    },
    {
      "type": "assert",
      "query": "game.kills",
      "op": "ge",
      "value": 8
    },
    {
      "type": "assert",
      "query": "game.lives",
      "op": "ge",
      "value": 3,
      "_comment": "无敌下命数只会涨不会跌：P2 的波次密度加上地面目标会越过 10 万的加命线，所以断言是'没掉命'而不是'正好 3 条'"
    },
    {
      "type": "log",
      "message": "地面目标：35 个摆在 .scad 里，打完前 48 秒至少该拆掉几个"
    },
    {
      "type": "assert",
      "query": "game.groundTotal",
      "op": "eq",
      "value": 35
    },
    {
      "type": "assert",
      "query": "game.groundDestroyed",
      "op": "gt",
      "value": 0
    },
    {
      "type": "log",
      "message": "掉落：前面几波带 power/medal，拾取后火力必然 >1"
    },
    {
      "type": "assert",
      "query": "game.power",
      "op": "gt",
      "value": 1
    },
    {
      "type": "screenshot",
      "out": "screenshots/combat_late",
      "ui": true
    },
    {
      "type": "log",
      "message": "碎片预算是硬上限，超了说明回收没生效"
    },
    {
      "type": "assert",
      "query": "game.debrisAlive",
      "op": "le",
      "value": 64
    },
    {
      "type": "key",
      "code": "Z",
      "action": "up"
    },
    {
      "type": "quit"
    }
  ]
}
